&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;IEA WEO2022「Net‐Zero Emissions by 2050 Scenario（NZE）」&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;IEA WEO2022「Sustainable Development Scenario（SDS）」&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;IPCC AR6「Shared Socio-economic Pathways（SSP1-2.6）」&lt;/p&gt;
